\newlabel{fig:dcd_teaser}{{1}{1}{Cross-domain results of DCD. Each column shows a raw test image (top) and the DCD prediction overlaid in cyan (bottom). Trained on only 18 images from six Seen datasets and deployed at a single fixed candidate rank (slot 3), DCD preserves thin structures and connectivity on two Unseen and two Novel datasets}{figure.caption.1}{}}
